# tgloggerd

A Telegram logger daemon using a user account. Its core library is
TDLib, and its database is MySQL 9. It logs user messages, message edit
history, and user history such as username, name, and photo changes.

# Project Structure

src/ - main tgloggerd source code directory
submodules/ - submodules directory, currently containing only TDLib.

# Interaction with TDLib

Keep interaction with TDLib via tgloggerd to a minimum because TDLib
has very large headers, which slow tgloggerd's compilation.

The main interaction with TDLib is in these files:

	src/tgloggerd/TDLib.cpp
	src/tgloggerd/TDLib.hpp

TDLib header files are expected.cpp only. TDLib functions are exposed
via the tgloggerd::TDLib class.

Other tgloggerd sources that need TDLib functions should include
TDLib.hpp rather than the TDLib headers directly, and use the
tgloggerd::TDLib class.
